SPEC sensor_overheat
METADATA PROVENANCE_REQUIRED true
METADATA SOURCE motor_temp temp_sensor
ACTIVATION OK
BLOCK OK
TYPES OK
TERM 1 MUST controller stop_drive DEADLINE 1794211230 : BREACHED 1794211230 ESCALATED safety_engineer FULFILLED
TERM 2 ON_BREACH controller : BOUND 1
TERM 3 MUST_NOT arm move : BREACHED 1794211221
INVARIANT cooled_down : U
MONITOR 3 : ENTRY 2 BLOCK
